u.be/75Sk_4fkgIM?t=2299","https://youtu.be/75Sk_4fkgIM?t=2333"]},{"field":"fg_pct","text":"More threes and a bigger creation load cost about half a point of FG% on about 16 attempts.","sources":["https://youtu.be/75Sk_4fkgIM?t=2299"]},{"field":"floor","text":"The floor is the hamstring limiting his minutes again, like last season's many 20-minute games. His range is wide after last season.","sources":["https://youtu.be/CRLSsoGhb2w?t=627"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}